  "details": "Sometimes people add friends and after a while may not remember where they made those friends or who they are. I think it would be great to allow people the opportunity to create little notes that show up in their friends profile to remind them where they met or what they talked about. After all, people use different avatars and may even change their names sometimes, so it’s not like you can remember peoples faces or anything.",
